WEBVTT

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:05.690
Goldymarg...

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:11.240
GGG has poured all of its resources into building this ultimate multi-robot.

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:15.200
He is equipped with a new A.I. System...

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.080
...patterned on Geki Hyuuma's personality.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.000
In tool form, the Marg Hand serves as GaoGaiGar's right arm...

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:25.040
...and his specialized armor can withstand...

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:27.710
...even the destructive power of the Goldion Hammer.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.140
Hammer Hell and Heaven has replaced Hell and Heaven as...

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:39.890
...GaoGaiGar's final attack, relieving Cyborg Gai of any physical strain.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:43.270
The Goldion Hammer is able to convert all substances...

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:47.190
...into light energy below the electron level.

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:54.200
Clearly, the most powerful King of Braves on Earth has been born!

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.150
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:01.050
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:07.630
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:12.050
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:18.770
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:23.050
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:23.050 --> 00:01:27.970
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:27.970 --> 00:01:31.890
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:34.690
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:38.450
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:43.450
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:46.620
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:49.160
Final Fusion, approved!

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:52.290
Now transform into a superhero!

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:55.250
Warping dimensional space!

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:59.330
Dividing Driver!

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:06.970
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:12.850
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:15.800
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:19.690
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:21.450
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:24.450
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:27.120
To the Corrupted Sky

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:29.920
<i>To the Corrupted Sky</i>

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:39.680
Point Zero-One, now at target airspace.

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:42.930
Prepare to fire! Open the missile bay doors!

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:44.850
Now opening the missile bay doors!

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:48.230
Sights locked, target in the crosshairs!

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:49.690
Bombs away!

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:12.130
All right!

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.760
How did you like it? Did you enjoy the simulation?

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:21.470
Thank you! It really blew me away!

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:42.030
The sky is indeed marvelous...

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:57.800
All right, next in line, you may go in now!

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:01.840
Hey, Hana, this plane is a tactical bomber called the B-52.

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:07.720
In terms of weight, it's got a weapons payload of 24.3 tons!

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:12.350
There's a whole line of B-52s like this one, from Type A to Type H...

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:15.770
They built a total of 744 B-52s in all, you know.

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:17.980
This one here's a Type H.

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:21.320
You're really into stuff like this, huh, Ayame?

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:28.330
Oh, my gosh! I just love the sound of these engines!

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:33.250
These are TF33 Turbofan engines made by Pratt & Whitney!

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:36.670
Ayame, don't you think something strange is going on?

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:45.260
It looks like they're going to fly the plane for us!

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:09.740
Hey! The B-52 just took off!

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.660
Wait a minute, isn't that...

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:12.660
It's a Zonder!

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:14.710
Big Brother!

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:17.880
Right. I'll be going now, okay?

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:26.260
Hey, you've got a bite, Mamoru!

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:28.300
Wow! It's a big one!

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:30.640
Here goes!

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:35.180
Huh?

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:37.190
Sorry, Takayasu! Take this for me, will you?

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.020
You're kidding, right?

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:45.900
Special Agent Mamoru...

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.070
Volfogg! It's a Zonder!

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:50.370
Please get in.

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:53.540
I will contact the GGG Main Order Room.

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:58.420
Order Room, lift down!

00:05:58.580 --> 00:05:59.290
Go!

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:21.310
So this old-fashioned bomber's a Zonder?

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:24.900
Mamoru sensed it was a Zonder when it came near.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:25.820
There's no question.

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:31.200
It's a tactical bomber used heavily by the U.S. Air Force 50 years ago...

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:32.780
The B-52!

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:35.160
This is what our tracker picked up.

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:37.710
It's infiltrating the SDF airbase!

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:40.210
Hard to believe that it was able to absorb...

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:42.080
...such an enormous amount of bombs and missiles...

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:43.630
That's it! Right there!

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:54.890
The B-52 Zonder is currently flying over the Hachioji area.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:57.060
Just where is it headed?

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:00.440
I'm crunching the data now, and...

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:02.230
It's headed here!

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:24.880
Heading out, guys?

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.340
What happened, anyway?

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:29.260
A Zonder just showed up!

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:30.880
Let's get going, EnRyu!

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:31.930
Right!

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:33.800
Hold it!

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:36.310
Aren't there any orders for me?

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:39.270
For now, you're to remain on standby.

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:41.690
Later, Goldymarg!

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:45.610
How come I'm the only one getting left behind?

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:55.370
Just like I thought. It's a Zonder!

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:16.300
Cannon Blue!

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.220
Cannon Red!

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:30.820
Chief, I see children!

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.280
There are two girls on board!

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:36.410
They must've come to see the air show and somehow got taken!

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:39.620
We can't attack with those children on board!

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.210
Hey, this flight is getting cooler by the minute!

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.380
I'm not afraid! I'm not afraid!

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:12.530
Gai!

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:15.490
Your top priority is to rescue those trapped kids.

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:16.910
Roger!

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:34.510
Fusion!

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:47.560
GaiGar!

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:53.570
I'm not afraid...

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:55.150
Where are you going?

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:58.030
We can't just sit here and do nothing, can we?

00:09:58.610 --> 00:09:59.740
Special Agent Mamoru...

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:02.910
...remember that you and I have our own unique duties to carry out.

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.290
Let us put our faith in the Mobile Unit.

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:08.420
Being patient is also part of the battle.

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:12.130
I guess you're right.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:19.260
Come on!

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:25.640
GaiGar, StealthGao and DrillGao are now in simultaneous equip mode.

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:26.600
Docking complete!

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:31.650
So you showed up, did you, Cyborg?

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:32.940
I've been waiting for you.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:36.780
You can fight all you want, but this planet is finished.

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:37.860
It's too late.

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:48.500
This planet is finished.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.830
It's too late...

00:10:57.460 --> 00:11:01.340
I no longer remember what happened in the past.

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:03.220
It was a long time ago...

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:06.770
Yes, it was such a long time ago.

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:13.400
This is Hyuuma.

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:15.360
This is Goldymarg.

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:16.480
What do you want?

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:18.030
Orders to mobilize, that's what!

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:19.240
No, you're not ready!

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:20.820
I'm tired of sitting on my butt like this!

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:24.330
Idiot! You're stuck there for a reason...

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:27.700
...because you've got a different job than the rest of the Mobile Unit!

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:32.170
You're GaoGaiGar's ultimate attack tool, don't ever forget that!

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:34.750
The enemy's right above me...

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:36.550
You expect me to just hang out?

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:42.380
Chief! You've got to see this!

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:45.260
Gate No. 2 in the Metal Locker Room...

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:47.560
Goldymarg's destroying it!

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.230
W-What did you say?

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:51.140
No!

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:53.150
Where do you think you're going, Goldymarg?

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:55.020
Ms. Utsugi!

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:58.690
It's no good, I can't access his A.I. program!

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:02.150
I can't boot the Emergency Remote Shutdown program, either!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:18.920
And we just finished all the repairs on Goldymarg last week...

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:19.630
Here we go again!

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:22.550
What unbelievable power!

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:48.200
Oh, man! I'm gonna have to get closer!

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:10.010
System Change!

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:19.860
Goldytank!

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:36.870
Get back to base, Goldytank!

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:45.170
Now that I'm here, you can let me handle it!

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:54.890
Stop shooting!

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:57.940
There are two girls on board that enemy vessel!

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.610
Idiots! You need to clue me in on things like that!

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:06.610
Goldytank!

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:08.780
Did he just run over that bomb and crush it?

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:15.790
You moron! That was dangerous!

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:17.120
Now get the heck out of there!

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:20.040
Oh, forgive me!

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:23.460
That armor of his is incredible!

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.550
Just what do you think you're doing, Goldytank?

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:32.470
I'm going to get closer, and shoot that thing down!

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:34.600
Get down from there, you idiot!

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:36.930
My A.I. was based on you, Major!

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:39.520
That makes you an idiot too, doesn't it?

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:41.400
What did you say, you big imbecile?

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:44.020
You and your Godzilla Mohawk!

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:47.900
What's up with those two, anyway?

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:50.240
Sounds like two brothers squabbling.

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:55.410
Hurry! Come on, hurry, Hana!

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:56.870
What's going on?

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.000
No time to explain now...

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:00.540
Just do what I do!

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:01.540
Eject!

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:02.630
Eject!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:04.920
Uh-oh, we seem to have a problem!

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:26.280
System Change!

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:37.950
Goldymarg!

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:46.040
Special Agent Mamoru, I am going to rescue those two children.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:47.000
Okay!

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:58.020
Chief! I'm receiving the signal requesting Final Fusion approval!

00:15:58.390 --> 00:15:59.930
All right!

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:02.600
Final Fusion, approved!

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:03.560
Roger!

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:05.270
Final Fusion...

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:07.690
Program... drive!

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:20.290
Final Fusion!

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:58.330
GaoGaiGar!

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:23.180
This isn't good! It's going to crash-land right in the city!

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.100
The civilians!

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:29.520
Dividing Driver, speed up the launching process!

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:35.700
Coordinates, locked down!

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:49.170
Dividing Driver!

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:08.060
Goldymarg!

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:18.320
Now GaoGaiGar won't be able to use that bizarre hammer of his.

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:22.240
All that's left is to prevent him from using his Hell and Heaven attack.

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:30.540
Goldymarg is currently inaccessible!

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:33.920
Somehow we managed to avoid civilian casualties, didn't we?

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:38.340
But this means that once again, GaoGaiGar's lost his ultimate attack!

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:49.980
Broken Magnum!

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:55.190
So he fell for it.

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:01.030
Don't tell me...

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:04.660
Without that right arm, he can't even use Hell and Heaven.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:05.580
Gai!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:24.390
Zonder!

00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:34.270
It's all over now.

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:37.360
Stripped of his ultimate attack...

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:40.320
...GaoGaiGar is no more than a lump of mecha parts.

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:51.790
Goldymarg is back online!

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:54.000
All functions are normal!

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:56.880
So he survived! Goldymarg!

00:19:57.380 --> 00:19:59.260
I don't believe that robot!

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:01.800
After falling from such great heights!

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:04.220
No doubt about it, he's a hero, too!

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:06.640
GaoGaiGar! Use me!

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:09.560
Right! I've been waiting for you, Goldymarg!

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:15.270
Goldion Hammer...

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:17.320
Activation... approved!

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:21.990
Roger!

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:23.740
Goldion Hammer...

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:27.160
Safety Device, relieve!

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:33.870
System Change!

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:45.800
Hammer Connect!

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:54.270
Goldion Hammer!

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.040
Hammer Hell!

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:16.710
Hammer Heaven!

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:27.090
Transform into light!

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:42.650
Impossible!

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:49.620
We made it in time, Special Agent Mamoru.

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:51.080
Purify the Zonder, if you please.

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:51.700
Okay!

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:55.250
Curatio!

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:58.960
Teneritas, sectio...

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:03.260
...salus, coctura!

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:20.020
All right! We did it!

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:23.940
GaoGaiGar's new final attack is the Goldion Hammer...

00:22:24.030 --> 00:22:26.650
...which has replaced Hell and Heaven.

00:22:26.990 --> 00:22:30.530
And a robot more powerful than anyone had imagined, Goldymarg!

00:22:31.450 --> 00:22:34.370
As long as this new hero exists...

00:22:34.700 --> 00:22:37.870
GaoGaiGar shall never know the world "defeat"!

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:50.310
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:55.180
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:01.360
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:06.150
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:10.320
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:17.250
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:24.010
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:28.670
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:34.010
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:40.910
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.650 --> 00:23:48.740
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:49.240 --> 00:23:52.700
Dr. Liger, Dr. Shishioh's older brother, has just arrived from the U. S!

00:23:52.820 --> 00:23:56.160
He's brought a childlike robot who instantly bonds with...

00:23:56.410 --> 00:23:58.500
...Mamoru and his classmates, but what is his true identity?

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:00.790
Come on, Baribarien!

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:03.710
Come on, everybody! Let's fly across the skies with Mic!

00:24:03.920 --> 00:24:05.920
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:07.500
"Mic 13."

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:10.420
Mic 13

00:24:07.630 --> 00:24:10.470
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.450
Mic's Transport Container

00:24:13.300 --> 00:24:15.100
This is the Key to Victory!
